      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Two fixtures do it, and the only difference is how often each runs. Session scope means once. One login, at the top, for the whole suite. Function scope means again, for every single test. Same file. Totally different rhythm.",
      "data": {
        "scopeLadder": {
